{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_59","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\powershell.exe\" -Command \"Select-String -Path 'nodes\\\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py' -Pattern '\"'^def _resolve_style'\"','\"'^def get_era_tail'\"','\"'^def compose_still_prompt'\"','\"'^def finish_visual_prompt'\"','style=None','style:' -CaseSensitive\"","aggregated_output":"\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:296:# lane of get_era_tail (style=None) so pre-Stage-3 tests keep passing.\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:330:def _resolve_style(meta: Any, style: Any = None):\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:333:    re-resolve, r4 contract). ``style=None`` => fail-loud\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:344:def get_era_tail(meta: Any, profile: str = \"full\", style: Any = None) -> str:\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:352:    and passes the style down); ``style=None`` is the LEGACY lane and keeps\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:528:                     style: Any = None) -> str:\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:544:    form would double the authoring matrix). ``style=None`` is the LEGACY\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:590:def compose_still_prompt(meta: Any, *, kind: str, role: str = \"\",\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:592:                         style: Any = None) -> str:\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:667:def finish_visual_prompt(meta: Any, prompt: str, *, max_chars: int = 0,\r\nnodes\\_otr_story_brief_helpers.py:670:                         style: Any = None) -> str:\r\n\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
